# Scrapers — scripts AND outputs live outside the repo. The only contract
# between the scraper runner and this codebase is the `ingest-scrape` Edge
# Function HTTP boundary. Keeping the whole subtree ignored means a stray
# `git add .` can't leak vendor cookies, session tokens, or scraped data.
